    {
      "op": "ensure_block",
      "id": "readme_next_steps",
      "description": "Add README with pending items and scripts",
      "path": "README.md",
      "block_id": "project-readme",
      "block_content": "# LLM Chat Pro Frontend\n\nThis project implements the LLM Chat UI per the provided specification using React, Vite, TypeScript, Tailwind, and Zustand.\n\nQuickstart:\n- npm install\n- cp .env.example .env\n- npm run dev\n\nPending items to complete spec parity:\n- Virtualized lists (react-window) for messages/branches\n- Branch connection lines rendering and proper depth map\n- Streaming chat via SSE/WebSocket\n- Full minimap rendering\n- Tests (unit, integration, e2e)\n- Accessibility audit refinements\n- Performance budgets & Lighthouse\n\n",
      "anchor": "",
      "position": "after",
      "regex": false,
      "markers": {
        "start": "<!-- BEGIN:{id} -->",
        "end": "<!-- END:{id} -->"
      }
    }
